{
  "id": "E034",
  "title": "Registering at the Hospital",
  "level": "intermediate",
  "date": "2016-07-20",
  "synopsis": "Do you feel ill and need to visit a hospital in China? Here we learn how we can register when we arrive at the hospital.",
  "audioUrl": "https://static.duchinese.net/documents/192/807daf3e0306c04c3d0784067f7fbc0cb19098ea.mp3",
  "series": null,
  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "挂号\n \n小明：你好！\n护士：你好！你要挂号吗？\n小明：对，可是我不知道挂什么科。\n护士：你哪里不舒服？\n小明：我头疼，好像发烧了。\n护士：先量一下体温吧。\n小明：好的。\n护士：三十八度五，有点发热。你挂内科吧。挂号处在那边。\n小明：好的，谢谢！",
    "traditional": "掛號\n \n小明：你好！\n護士：你好！你要掛號嗎？\n小明：對，可是我不知道掛什麼科。\n護士：你哪裏不舒服？\n小明：我頭疼，好像發燒了。\n護士：先量一下體溫吧。\n小明：好的。\n護士：三十八度五，有點發熱。你掛內科吧。掛號處在那邊。\n小明：好的，謝謝！"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n \n",
      "traditional": "\n \n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Registering at the Hospital"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "小明：你好！",
      "traditional": "小明：你好！",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo míng nǐ hǎo",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Ming: Hello!"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "护士：你好！你要挂号吗？",
      "traditional": "護士：你好！你要掛號嗎？",
      "pinyin": "hù shi nǐ hǎo nǐ yào guà hào ma",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Nurse: Hello! Do you want to register?"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "小明：对，可是我不知道挂什么科。",
      "traditional": "小明：對，可是我不知道掛什麼科。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo míng duì kě shì wǒ bù zhī dào guà shén me kē",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Ming: Yes. But I don’t know at which department I should register."
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "护士：你哪里不舒服？",
      "traditional": "護士：你哪裏不舒服？",
      "pinyin": "hù shi nǐ nǎ lǐ bù shū fu",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Nurse: Where do you feel uncomfortable?"
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "小明：我头疼，好像发烧了。",
      "traditional": "小明：我頭疼，好像發燒了。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo míng wǒ tóu téng hǎo xiàng fā shāo le",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Ming: I have a headache, feels like I have a fever."
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "simplified": "护士：先量一下体温吧。",
      "traditional": "護士：先量一下體溫吧。",
      "pinyin": "hù shi xiān liáng yí xià tǐ wēn ba",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Nurse: Let me take your temperature."
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "simplified": "小明：好的。",
      "traditional": "小明：好的。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo míng hǎo de",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Ming: Ok."
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "simplified": "护士：三十八度五，有点发热。你挂内科吧。挂号处在那边。",
      "traditional": "護士：三十八度五，有點發熱。你掛內科吧。掛號處在那邊。",
      "pinyin": "hù shi sān shí bā dù wǔ yǒu diǎn fā rè nǐ guà nèi kē ba guà hào chù zài nà biān",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Nurse: 38.5 degrees. You have a fever. You can register at the medical department. The registration counter is over there."
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "simplified": "小明：好的，谢谢！",
      "traditional": "小明：好的，謝謝！",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo míng hǎo de xiè xie",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "simplified": "",
      "traditional": "",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Ming: Ok, Thank you."
    }
  ],
